   174	`P(−κ_13) = 1 + 3^d − 4^d < 0`; `P(κ_23) = 4^d − 2^d + (−2)^d > 0`; `P(−κ_23) = 2^{d+1} − 4^d < 0`;
   175	`P(κ_123) = 4^d − 2^d − 1 + (−1)^d > 0`; `P(−κ_123) = 2 + 2^d − 4^d < 0` (all for `d ≥ 2`, `d ≥ 3` where
